OL,3,AUK lost more than it gained from
OL,4,ABrexit, Burnham to say ahead of EU
OL,5,Asummit
OL,6,
OL,7,FHe is seeking to sign new agreements on
OL,8,Ffood, energy and youth mobility with
OL,9,Fthe bloc at Friday's summit, where he
OL,10,Fhas said a "win-win" deal can be
OL,11,Fstruck.
OL,13,FThe Conservatives have said Labour are
OL,14,F"dragging us into the European Union
OL,15,Fvia the back door with their EU reset".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
