OL,3,APrince and Princess of Wales arrive in
OL,4,AIndia ahead of meeting with Modi
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Prince and Princess of Wales have
OL,7,Farrived in India for a three-day visit
OL,8,Fthat will include a meeting with Indian
OL,9,FPrime Minister Narendra Modi.
OL,11,FThe visit is the first time William and
OL,12,FCatherine have been on an official
OL,13,Foverseas trip together in four years.
OL,15,FHer cancer treatment has limited the
OL,16,Famount of international travel she has
OL,17,Fundertaken but she will be with her
OL,18,Fhusband for several engagements this
OL,19,Fweek.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
