OL,3,AZelensky urges US and Musk to lift
OL,4,AStarlink restrictions and be on 'right
OL,5,Aside of history'
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe issue over the speed of the
OL,8,FStarshield system - a military-grade
OL,9,Fservice developed by Elon Musk's
OL,10,FStarlink and provided to Ukraine by the
OL,11,FUS government - has been rumbling on
OL,12,Ffor weeks.
OL,14,FZelensky said he had asked officials
OL,15,F"to work as closely as possible" with
OL,16,Fthe US government and Musk's company.
OL,17,F"It is important to be on the right
OL,18,Fside of history," he said. The BBC has
OL,19,Fasked the White House and Starlink for
OL,20,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
