OL,3,AAustralian MP 'full of gratitude' upon
OL,4,Aleaving hospital after alleged car
OL,5,Aattack
OL,6,
OL,7,FBrendan Nugent, 43, has been charged
OL,8,Fwith dangerous driving causing serious
OL,9,Finjury, intentionally causing serious
OL,10,Finjury and the federal offence of
OL,11,Fcausing harm to a public official. He
OL,12,Fhas yet to enter pleas.
OL,14,FIn her first public comments since the
OL,15,Fattack, Haines, 65, said she had moved
OL,16,Finto the rehabilitation stage of her
OL,17,Frecovery.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
